      "side": 1,
      "message": "As long as the risk is acknowledged and there is rollback plan if something major breaks, I guess I am ok with this. \n\nRe: not sure understand how other components could be affected by this CL, that\u0027s the problem with removing exported components that have long been in place. I did a quick cs/ on some of these and looks like we should be ok, so will resolve this under the assumption there is rollback plan in place. \n\nI\u0027d recommend in future might be good to consider looping in DRIs on changes like this as suggested in chat previously, so there is better understanding of blast radius on CLs like this ahead of submission.",
